# .depobituaryignore — Dependency Obituary direct-dep exclusion list.
#
# Format: gitignore-style, one package name per line. Lines starting
# with '#' are comments. Wildcards (`*`) are supported by the action
# but are FORBIDDEN by Anchorix policy — every entry below must be an
# exact package name. See CLAUDE.md §11.
#
# Each entry must have a comment immediately above it explaining:
#   - why it is excluded
#   - the score that justified the exclusion (at the time of writing)
#   - how to remove it
# Adding a line without that justification is a CLAUDE.md violation.
#
# This file is the source of truth for Dependency Obituary exclusions.
# It is loaded by bin/check.js via loadAllowlist(); excluded packages
# are still scored and tagged IGNORED in the report, so they remain
# visible — they just do not contribute to the threshold-fail decision.

# eslint-plugin-react — current obituary score 45 (below threshold 60).
# The de-facto React linting plugin in the ecosystem; useful for future
# frontend maturity. Excluded so v0.1 foundation can ship without
# retiring the linter or weakening the gate. Reversible: delete the
# line below to re-arm the gate for this package.
eslint-plugin-react
